<p>This is a collab between myself and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606113151" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;">djkaktus</a></span>, refining ol' plague boy into something more appropriate for today's standards.</p>
<p>Huge thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theesherm" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1583637); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1583637&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606113151" alt="TheeSherm" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1583637)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theesherm" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1583637); return false;">TheeSherm</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taylor-itkin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3208919); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3208919&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606113151" alt="taylor_itkin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3208919)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taylor-itkin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3208919); return false;">taylor_itkin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1414765); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1414765&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606113151" alt="Doctor Cimmerian" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1414765)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1414765); return false;">Doctor Cimmerian</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/volgunstrife" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1342156); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1342156&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606113151" alt="VolgunStrife" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1342156)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/volgunstrife" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1342156); return false;">VolgunStrife</a></span> for the awesome work on the audio logs. Credit goes to <span class="error-inline"><em>Dex V</em> does not match any existing user name</span> for the new images.</p>
